    <!-- Pomoc (Globalna) -->
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Title">Help</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_Default">Select a tab from the left menu to start working.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_CustomerPanelPage">In this section, you can view the list of your orders, their statuses, and download a report if an order is assigned to your account.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_DashboardPage">A dashboard summarizing the most important statistics in the dealership. Here you will find a quick overview of the number of cars, new orders, and ongoing repairs.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_ClientsPage">A module for managing the customer database. Here you can register a new customer, generate a report for them, and review their full purchase history.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_SalesPanelPage">A list of currently processed orders. Allows you to change the status and verify progress for each order (e.g., from 'Ready for pickup' to 'Finished').</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_SalesRecordsPage">Browse the full registry of all transactions. You can filter orders by status, dealership, advisor, or date range. The table provides quick insight into sales details such as the assigned vehicle, VIN, client, advisor, and current fulfillment status.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_CreateOrder">Start a new sale. Select a customer (or create a new one), match the right vehicle, choose optional configuration, and finalize the transaction.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_VehiclesPage">Manage cars on the lot. Here you can add new vehicles from the factory database (Engine + Model), specify whether they are new or used, and provide VIN numbers.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_ServicesPage">Mechanic workshop. Service technicians can take on new jobs here (e.g., accessory installation) and change their statuses to in-progress or finally completed.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_ReportsPage">Generate advanced PDFs to understand company performance. Reports include full analytics, colorful charts, and employee rankings.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Help_AdminPage">Administrator panel for managing the database (e.g., adding new dealerships) and registering new employee accounts with specific roles.</system:String>

